{"id":"625582","name":"芹菜拌包菜","author":"蓝雨阳光780913","authorId":"11379263","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/625582/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"包菜","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"芹菜","amount":"20g"},{"name":"青菜","amount":"20g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"包菜一瓣一瓣掰下来。","img":"images/625582/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入盐开水中烫。","img":"images/625582/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"芹菜切碎。","img":"images/625582/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出烫熟的包菜，去掉茎切成丝。","img":"images/625582/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"青菜切成丝一起抓匀，放入盐调味。","img":"images/625582/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放上芹菜碎即可。","img":"images/625582/step_6.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}